                  "name": "search_users"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "`search_users` reads as read-only but declares no `readOnlyHint`.\n\nSet `readOnlyHint: true` on `search_users`. This is the annotation that *earns* you calls rather than costing them: clients use it to run safe tools without interrupting the user, and an unmarked read gets the same confirmation prompt as a delete."
          },
