          "message": {
            "text": "Every word in `doStuff` is generic, so the name says nothing about what the tool operates on.\n\nRename `doStuff` to verb-plus-object form that names the subject -- `search_users`, `create_support_ticket`, `archive_ticket`. A model ranks tools by name before it reads a single description, and a name that would fit on any server in the world gives it nothing to match against."
          },
