          "message": {
            "text": "`doStuff` changes state but declares no `idempotentHint`.\n\nSay whether calling `doStuff` twice with the same arguments is the same as calling it once. Clients use this to decide whether a timed-out call can be retried; without it the safe assumption is no, and the user is asked to sort out a call that may or may not have happened."
          },
